fixture jump_two_ticks_before_wall_is_not_late
doc BUILD.md s5 feel rule 1, every input "acted on the same frame" (movement review 5, L6). Falling toward the shaft wall (800 u) at run speed, jump pressed 11.5 u short with the air jump unspent: this tick's move does not cling, so the press is not held for one. The air jump fires on the press frame; it used to wait a frame and fire as a kick.
room test/shaft
spawn 720 300
frames 30
input
  0..9 R
  10..29 R jump
end
expect
  at 10 event.air_jump=1 vy<0
  never 0..29 event.wall_kick=1
end
